pcs_an_tx(trx)     e031

-- ********************************************************************************************* --
-- 28. Provide a link of /C/ codes corresponding to the abilities of the link partner. 
--    Contents of RX_CONFIG Register = PCS Auto. Neg Link Partner Advertisment Register 
--              7------6------5------4------3------2------1------0   15------14------13------12------11------10------9------8    
